ell us when product or recipe information needs attention.","availability":"foundation_unverified"},{"key":"Recipe community","value":"Share recipes while keeping their authors and sources visible.","availability":"foundation_unverified"},{"key":"Positive achievements","value":"Celebrate variety, organisation and taking part.","availability":"foundation_unverified"},{"key":"Global information","value":"Bring product knowledge from different countries into one place.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Non-food products","value":"Find out about everyday items, not just food.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Product categories","value":"See how each scanned product has been classified.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Complete details","value":"Explore the available source information beyond the summary.","availability":"future"},{"key":"English food knowledge","value":"Connect international food names through shared English terms.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Recipe steps","value":"Follow clear cooking steps with ingredients and amounts linked together.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Recipe scaling","value":"Adjust quantities for the portions you want to make.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Substitutions","value":"Review alternatives without hiding changes to nutrition or ingredients.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Recipe nutrition","value":"See nutrition for the whole recipe and each serving.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Use-first meals","value":"Find ideas that help you use food already waiting in your kitchen.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Reusable plans","value":"Adapt a favourite week for attendance, time and equipment.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Private recipes","value":"Keep family recipes and permitted bookmarks in your own collection.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Receipt capture","value":"Check and correct receipt details before adding items.","availability":"future"},{"key":"Food containers","value":"Track food you open, f